OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWinds soon strengthening with a
OL,6,Frisk of gales developing. Otherwise it
OL,7,Fwill be a mostly cloudy day with some
OL,8,Fbright spells and staying largely dry.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy in the
OL,11,Fevening and overnight with rain
OL,12,Fspreading southwards and becoming
OL,13,Fheavy at times. Winds easing a touch
OL,14,Fovernight but still strong at times.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FCloudy with rain, heavy at
OL,17,Ftimes, slowly clearing to the south
OL,18,Fthrough the morning and early
OL,19,Fafternoon. Drier with bright spells
OL,20,Fdeveloping later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
