OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and showers early Friday, then
OL,7,Fdrier with clearer skies later. Mostly
OL,8,Fdry with sunny spells and light winds
OL,9,Fthrough the weekend. Chillier nights
OL,10,Fthan of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
